<section class="project" id="p2">
<h2>lamp room</h2>
<p class="path"><lamp room>/TODO.md</p>
<section id="p2-planning">
<h3>Planning</h3>
<p class="hint">What the planner still has to do. The target level is 1: a task at or below it needs complete detail before a worker is handed it.</p>
<h4>Open tasks per level</h4>
<p class="hint">Open, claimed or blocked tasks, counted by their level.</p>
<ul class="areas levels">
<li><span>1</span><span class="count">0</span></li>
<li><span>2</span><span class="count">0</span></li>
<li><span>3</span><span class="count">0</span></li>
<li><span>4</span><span class="count">0</span></li>
<li><span>5</span><span class="count">0</span></li>
<li><span class="muted">no level</span><span class="count">2</span></li>
</ul>
<h4>Not ready for lack of detail (0)</h4>
<p class="empty">Every task at or below the target level has its detail.</p>
<h4>Given back to the planner (0)</h4>
<p class="empty">Nothing given back.</p>
<h4>Kept above the target level on purpose (0)</h4>
<p class="empty">Nothing kept above the target level.</p>
<h4>Waves</h4>
<p class="empty">No unfinished task, so no waves.</p>
</section>
